          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best dust collector for most garage shops is the Jet DC-1100VX-5M, which pairs 1,100 CFM with enough static pressure for a short duct run on standard household power. Small shops should start with the Shop Fox W1727 or the budget WEN DC3401, and big ducted shops should look at the Grizzly G0441 cyclone.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whichever you choose, judge it on airflow at the tool rather than the box, upgrade 5-micron bags to finer filtration, and add an air filter and respirator for sanding. Collection, filtration and protection together are what keep a shop healthy.
          </p>
